    {
      "id": "SnIEgXTUz5umxeD83bdc1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 350.80078125,
      "y": 233.6171875,
      "width": 787.6195068359375,
      "height": 1075,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b54",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1035237555,
      "version": 1007,
      "versionNonce": 787171818,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786055903300,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Whatsapp\n\nFunctional Requirements:\n1. Users should be able to create group chat of 2 - 100 people\n2. Users should be able to send and receive messages\n3. Users should be receive message when they are offline\n4. Users should be able to send media in the message\n\nNon-functional Requirements:\n1. Scalability: 1 Billion users, each user send 10 messages per day\n2. Latency < 500 MS\n3. Guaranteed message delivery\n4. Fault tolerance, the system should be resilient when part of the services fails\n5. Messages and media should no longer last than needed\n\nCore Entities:\n1. Users\n2. Chat\n3. Message\n4. Media\n5. Client \n\nEvents:\n\nClient to Server:\n\ncreateChat {\n    chatName,\n    participants\n} -> chatId\n\nsendMessage {\n    content\n} -> SUCCESS | FAILURE, messageId\n\nuploadMedia {\n    content\n} -> SUCCESS | FAILURE\n\nServer to Client:\n\nnewMessage\nchatUpdate",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Whatsapp\n\nFunctional Requirements:\n1. Users should be able to create group chat of 2 - 100 people\n2. Users should be able to send and receive messages\n3. Users should be receive message when they are offline\n4. Users should be able to send media in the message\n\nNon-functional Requirements:\n1. Scalability: 1 Billion users, each user send 10 messages per day\n2. Latency < 500 MS\n3. Guaranteed message delivery\n4. Fault tolerance, the system should be resilient when part of the services fails\n5. Messages and media should no longer last than needed\n\nCore Entities:\n1. Users\n2. Chat\n3. Message\n4. Media\n5. Client \n\nEvents:\n\nClient to Server:\n\ncreateChat {\n    chatName,\n    participants\n} -> chatId\n\nsendMessage {\n    content\n} -> SUCCESS | FAILURE, messageId\n\nuploadMedia {\n    content\n} -> SUCCESS | FAILURE\n\nServer to Client:\n\nnewMessage\nchatUpdate",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
